WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.107
Another evening on the bike. Same wall, same numbers, same thirty minutes.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.554
The bike is smart. It just never gives you a reason to come back tomorrow.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:24.637
Meet Telo Ride. It turns your smart bike at home into a game.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.525
One press pairs it over Bluetooth. Telo Ride reads your power, and sets the

00:00:35.525 --> 00:00:38.193
resistance for every hill and interval.

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:47.911
It runs in Chrome or Edge, on a phone, a tablet or a desktop.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:50.452
Pair once, and it remembers your bike.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.846
Next comes Race. Ride a map against the ghost of your best time, a pack of bots, or

00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:02.939
other riders.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:13.625
Then Classes. Ride along to a video, alone or with a group.

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:24.981
Both feed one progression: XP, rider levels, stars, and map unlocks.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:36.397
And for your own intervals, a custom workout, under Profile.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:45.561
Telo Ride. Your bike, now a game.

00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:50.509
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:50.855 --> 00:01:55.366
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.037
every hill and interval.

00:01:57.382 --> 00:02:02.560
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:08.008
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:08.008 --> 00:02:10.998
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:11.343 --> 00:02:13.836
A custom workout lives under Profile.
